From: Girija P <gpandiya@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 11:11:39 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] BSTA MLD reconfiguration with supplicant restart - Skeleton 
 UCI option bsta_reconfigure_with_supplicant_restart from the prplmesh config 
 to enable/disable support runtime Add a new 
 ACTION_BACKHAUL_SUPPLICANT_RESTART message and its handler to trigger 
 wpa_supplicant restart after all radios are updated with BSTA MLD info.

Signed-off-by: Girija P <gpandiya@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
